// Low Pass  [audioEffect] — one knob that muffles, 0 (open) to 100 (a corner at 200 Hz). The blindtest's
// "lowpass", reimplemented: same geometric curve, so a question written against the WebAudio one is unchanged.
// Its DSP is described in jsdsp.ts beside this file, not compiled into the engine.
plugin({ type: "jsdsp", name: "Low Pass" })
params({ Amount: 0 })
// A resonance-free low-pass whose corner runs from 20 kHz at 0 to 200 Hz at 100, geometrically. At 0 it is above the material rather than bypassed, which is what lets a chain automate it from nothing to everything.
